# Docs Chain runtime state (regenerable per §11.4.77) — never committed by a
# consuming project. The per-context YAML under .docs_chain/contexts/ IS
# tracked; only the generated hash baseline + transient sidecars are ignored.
.docs_chain/state.json
*.docs_chain.tmp

# Go build/test artefacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.*
profile.cov

# Compiled Go binary (build artifact, regeneratable via go build)
/docs_chain

# Cross-compiled Windows binaries (never produced by this module today, but
# any consumer building a Windows target for the CLI MUST NOT ever land the
# resulting .exe here — Task #44 defensive entry, §11.4.30 build-artifact
# discipline).
*.exe
